# MAYOR OF BUKITTINGGI

# PROVINCE OF WEST SUMATRA

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF BUKITTINGGI CITY

# NUMBER 4 OF 2015

# CONCERNING

# PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN

# BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

# THE MAYOR OF BUKITTINGGI,

Considering:  
a. that in order to guarantee and protect the rights of women and children so that they can participate optimally in accordance with human dignity and honor, and receive protection from violence, discrimination and violations, protection efforts need to be carried out;  
b. that in order for the protection efforts for women and children to obtain optimal results, there needs to be concrete action from the regional government and community participation;  
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning the Protection of Women and Children;  

In View of:  
1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;  

2. Law Number 9 of 1956 concerning the Establishment of Autonomous Regions of Large Cities Within the Provincial Region of Central Sumatra (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1956 Number 20);  
3. Law Number 1 of 1974 concerning Marriage (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1974 Number 1, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3019);  
4. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3243);  
5. Law Number 8 of 1981 concerning Criminal Procedure Law (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1981 Number 76, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3209);  
6. Law Number 7 of 1984 concerning Ratification of the Convention on the Elimination of All Forms of Discrimination Against Women (Convention On The Elimination Of All Forms Of Discrimination Against Women) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1984 Number 29);  
7. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165 Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3886);  
8. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235), as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);  
9. Law Number 13 of 2003 concerning Manpower (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 39, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4279);  
10. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);  
11. Law Number 21 of 2007 concerning the Eradication of the Criminal Act of Trafficking in Persons (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4720);  
12. Law Number 11 of 2009 concerning Social Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2009 Number 11, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4967);  
13. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning the Formulation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234);  
14. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587), as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);  
15. Government Regulation Number 38 of 2007 concerning the Division of Government Affairs Between the Government, Provincial Regional Government and Regency/City Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2007 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4737);  
16. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 of 2008 concerning Guidelines for the Implementation of Improving the Quality of Life of Women;  
17. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2008 concerning the Implementation of Women's Protection;  
18. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 3 of 2008 concerning Guidelines for the Implementation of Child Protection;  
19. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 15 of 2010 concerning General Guidelines for Handling Children in Conflict with the Law;  
20. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2011 concerning Handling of Child Victims of Violence;  
21. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 1 of 2014 concerning the Formulation of Regional Legal Products (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 32;  
22. Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 6 of 2000 concerning Civil Servant Investigators (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City of 2000 Number 7);  
23. Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 11 of 2008 concerning the Establishment of Organization and Work Procedures of Regional Technical Institutions of Bukittinggi City (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City of 2008 Number 11), as amended by Regional Regulation of Bukittinggi City Number 9 of 2013 (Regional Gazette of Bukittinggi City of 2013 Number 9).  

With Mutual Approval of THE REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF BUKITTINGGI CITY And

# THE MAYOR OF BUKITTINGGI

# HAS DECIDED:

To Establish: REGIONAL REGULATION CONCERNING THE PROTECTION OF WOMEN AND CHILDREN.

